              <p data-lang="zh">匹兹堡大学，美国宾州匹兹堡</p>
              <p data-lang="en">Advisor: <a href="https://www.leifang.org/team" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prof. Lei Fang</a></p>
